14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The true range is the distance between a period's extremes.

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
It is the largest of these three values.

16
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The current period's high minus the previous period's close.

